56580770_3389689203286189328_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hUL6ZekeGgsQ7kNvwHf8o3V&_nc_oc=AdpXqvnMXn2RTwCHDr6FJewpsx-f3BvgMGl1Q1LKyxxctL_qXhzRVYeVWK9IwLQwV7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0z1MWisDwnVNON7hzPmV90Dm7jA-KGahw4-xC4d6VaZQ&oe=69F1FD40"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1274699934250911", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307315_1274699937584244_8569799209673060711_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-JeY2xiV0qYQ7kNvwGCXHWR&_nc_oc=Adrh8jFeFy-jJpRH8utCvY7QbBGMaSQABpEEVhjov1kUAs3S7kKz1XQfqU_761ZHfOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2K6ZPlprerWJ959PEPUq2XEqNtsLivr3tw3PamhLbJOg&oe=69F1FB69"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u0411\u0435\u0437 \u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-4.png", "id": "1709948519886888", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301053_1709948523220221_7813363641265614497_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lvfqL52LwbgQ7kNvwEuPWNK&_nc_oc=AdpWZMQCBqwLZTxYFcsGbgIjRR7mHYxlV31ouTDlYxAfXtr1OTZW5ITDoKwWfeYrquk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0mm0KYJFGtG2YTFJ0e4QGZqaRaydNAr_sPJqlKWAx4Mw&oe=69F1E5B8"}, "display_name": "Rainbow Hide and Seek", "keywords": ["horror", "survival", "escape", "hide", "seek"], "long_description": "Dive into the eerie world of **Rainbow Hide and Seek** \u2014 a thrilling hide-and-seek adventure designed for Meta Quest 2 / 3 / Pro! Your mission: collect all 10 toys scattered throughout a mysterious house while evading the relentless Rainbow, a quirky yet menacing entity. Explore dimly lit rooms, solve simple puzzles, and use stealth to survive in this immersive VR environment.\n\n# **Features**\n- **Eerie Atmosphere**: Explore dark rooms with stunning visuals.\n- **Unique Antagonist**: Dodge the Rainbow!\n- **Casual Gameplay**: Perfect for players of all levels.\n\nCan you escape before Rainbow finds you? Ideal for casual gamers seekin